{"name": "Legacy of Pandora", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/cf946babf255bad3d844498b08a3e8b5.webp?t=1779556569\" height=\"172\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/cf946babf255bad3d844498b08a3e8b5.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve launched our Kickstarter Pre-Launch page! If you\u2019d like to support Legacy of Pandora before the campaign officially goes live, please click \u201c<strong>Notify me on launch</strong>\u201d. <strong>You can find the link from our social media bios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every follow really matters to us. As a small indie team, each supporter helps Legacy of Pandora get closer to Kickstarter\u2019s \u201c<i>Projects We Love.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to see the game become a reality, we sincerely hope you can help us reach 1,000 followers on Kickstarter. Thank you for supporting us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/2411e4ccd945de4f71757c91fa3adafb.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1386\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What if opening Pandora\u2019s Box didn\u2019t end the story\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may know the myth - when Pandora opened the Box, all evils were released into the world.\u00a0But when all seemed lost, Hope remained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you may not know is this:\u00a0From that Hope, she left behind a daughter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pyrrha</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/38e370cf8283a9fd5d14a511fdab6b4c.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/10d15f63ec71e6a90d8a2c3533496507.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1386\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In Legacy of Pandora, you play as Pyrrha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will tame strange and powerful monsters called Kakodemons, battle mortals and gods alike, explore a world shaped by ancient Greek myths, and face events where every decision leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can capture Kakodemons in battle. But be careful not to strike too hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"556\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/691a592240ba7ecbf6d780bb40f18181.poster.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/691a592240ba7ecbf6d780bb40f18181.webm?t=1779556569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/691a592240ba7ecbf6d780bb40f18181.mp4?t=1779556569\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Levels. No Traditional Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>no XP grind </strong>here.\u00a0Your monsters evolve through <strong>Corruption</strong>, shaped by your actions and moral choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through myth-inspired events with multiple outcomes, your choices will earn you different kinds of corruption:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Violence</strong> \u2022 <strong>Madness</strong> \u2022 <strong>Sorrow</strong> \u2022 <strong>Death</strong> \u2022 <strong>Greed</strong> \u2022 <strong>Disease</strong> \u2022\u00a0 <strong>Hope</strong> \u2022 <strong>Pride</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"72\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/a5668f314652b42eb6d0203a8df31f4b.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1363\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/ed2814e95eed74233a40286296948a4e.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1386\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Monsters That Reflect You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same creature can become something entirely different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A double-headed serpent corrupted by <strong>Greed</strong> may grow into a <strong>Hydra</strong>, its heads locked in endless conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another, twisted by\u00a0<strong>Disease</strong>, may rise as a corrupted\u00a0<strong>Caduceus</strong>\u00a0- once a symbol of healing, now sick and rusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7218303f660f509b6b72ac14e7b51722.poster.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7218303f660f509b6b72ac14e7b51722.webm?t=1779556569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7218303f660f509b6b72ac14e7b51722.mp4?t=1779556569\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each path leads to\u00a0<strong>radically different forms</strong>\u00a0 - there is no \u201ccorrect\u201d evolution, only a reflection of the path you take.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/f5d6124e3f3346dcb023b115e3f077c3.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1386\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Brain beats Brawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is <strong>turn-based </strong>and<strong> deeply strategic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Kakodemon has strengths and weaknesses -\u00a0choosing the wrong one can cost you the run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may raise many creatures\u2026\u00a0Or\u00a0<strong>sacrifice</strong>\u00a0<strong>them</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0<i>strengthen</i>\u00a0a single one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"780\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/a50dae460aeb3acd0d68576225f0382b.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through <strong>Flames of Will</strong>, earned in battle and sacrifice, you customize every Kakodemon build:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in <strong>Stats</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>Skills</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Define combat roles (DPS, support, tank, healer);</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two players may catch the same creature but end up with entirely different monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/a3b6e634b77d57a3ece6fdae935cc2bb.webp?t=1779556569\" height=\"760\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/a3b6e634b77d57a3ece6fdae935cc2bb.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/9ee1e3e82a19fe2c0bb2bbf0ea6a2a43.avif?t=1779556569\" width=\"1386\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No two teams are the same. No two stories repeat. Shape YOUR own myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now. Demo coming soon.</strong> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Turn-based roguelike inspired by Greek mythology. Capture and corrupt creatures, evolve through decisions, and face unique events across procedural maps. Your choices shape the story, your team, and Pandora\u2019s daughter.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/1d8961503a5d97f900c6d3520005f3c7857dae16/header.jpg?t=1779556569", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike", "Creature Collector", "Traditional Roguelike"], "developers": "OPP Studios", "publishers": "OPP Studios", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3973310", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QEpMTVRCdrk", "first_seen": 1779228000.0, "review_rank": 629}